      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Qualification grid\n\nModels: `kandinsky_imagesr_2.0.safetensors` (huggingface.co/hmdlsk/Kandinsky-ImageSR-2.0-ComfyUI) in `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/` and the FLUX.1 VAE `ae.safetensors` in `ComfyUI/models/vae/`.\n\nRuns the input through 2x and 4x at creativity 0, 4 and 8, plus a bicubic baseline at each scale, and saves every result with a descriptive prefix under `kandinsky_sr/qual_*`. Use it to judge identity retention, invented detail, noise handling and tile seams on your own images. Expect roughly 2x and 4x the runtime of a single upscale at the respective factor for the three creativity levels."
      ],
      "title": "Kandinsky ImageSR",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
